OL,3,GNEWSACinema memories shared as Savoy
OL,4,Abuilding sold
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt would be a "great shame" if a former
OL,7,Fcinema building became flats, a
OL,8,Ffilm-maker has said.
OL,10,FThe Savoy, a Wetherspoons' that used to
OL,11,Fbe a cinema on Regent Street, in
OL,12,FSwindon, has been sold to an
OL,13,Fundisclosed buyer and is due to shut on
OL,14,F8 November.
OL,16,FFor many Swindonians, it is the place
OL,17,Fwhere a little bit of Hollywood was
OL,18,Fbrought to Regent Street or the site of
OL,19,Ffond cinema memories.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
