OL,3,GNEWSACinema memories shared as Savoy
OL,4,Abuilding sold
OL,5,
OL,6,FFilm-maker Martin Parry MBE said it
OL,7,Fwould be "a great shame" if the Savoy
OL,8,Fbecame flats, while historian Graham
OL,9,FCarter said he hoped two blue plaques
OL,10,Fat the site would be protected amid any
OL,11,Ffuture development.
